-- examples/checks/asks-refused-promise.rofl — A PROMISE BROKEN OUTSIDE THE CONE IS NOT JUDGED.
-- rp_other is asked and reads only rp_src; the rule that breaks rp_mix's promise is in no premise of its cone. The
-- owner, 2026-10-31: a promise no rule of the cone reads is not judged, so the world answers its ask, and the
-- diagnostics name rp_mix as not judged (f_a_promise_outside_the_cone_is_not_judged). Without the asks it is refused.
asks(rp_other).
edb(rp_src).
rp_src(a, 2).
function rp_mix(K, to V).
rp_mix(a, 1).
rp_mix(K, V) :- rp_src(K, V).
rp_other(K) :- rp_src(K, _).
-- expect-row: rp_other[main](a)
